--- !u!114 &304771030
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 304771029}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51bf743a7b9a61e409329faa416e2f81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Ronin7.World::Ronin7.World.Story.DialoguePlayer
  lines:
  - speaker: Echo
    text: One through six. Flawed. Culled. You're seven, the first that worked. You
      came down here looking for whoever you're a copy of. There's no one. You're
      the bottom of it. Every cradle, every leash on every brother you've cut down,
      it all comes from you, because you're the one they could make it from. I'm
      so sorry. I wanted it to be the other answer.
    seconds: 14
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 27867f67f86f84441a3b2b1e08e1643d, type: 3}
  - speaker: Vale
    text: Now you understand what you're worth. You came down here hunting the oldest
      thing in the dark. Look at the racks, Cipher. You're the newest face in this
      room. Every cradle here starts with you. Every man fears he's a copy of something
      greater. You are the thing they copied. There is no shame in that, only scale.
      He is your proof, not your better. Put him down or don't, the readout says
      what it says. You are the original. Your only choice is whether the original
      dies in this room or rules from it.
    seconds: 22
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ae78c0c2e66bc5642b3974f04406ed4f, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: Six. They threw six people into the dark to get one that would hold still.
    seconds: 6
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 319ee5a86d6ba4c47bab5479c0f0b77a, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7 Edition
    text: Engaging. The original resists removal. Escalating to terminate.
    seconds: 5
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d039d3bb238f2ee4789ca187437d8847, type: 3}
  textMesh: {fileID: 1759161425}
  panelRoot: {fileID: 873054745}
  audioSource: {fileID: 304771031}
  billboardToCamera: 1
  playOnStart: 0
  followDistance: 1.5
  followVerticalOffset: -0.55
  followLerp: 12
  maxCharsPerLine: 36
  autoAdvanceBeat: 0.45
  advanceAction: {fileID: -3790664182463143341, guid: d5a2441a867c2484c888f3631c932d48, type: 3}
