  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Ronin7.World::Ronin7.World.Story.DialoguePlayer
  lines:
  - speaker: Echo
    text: That's the man who walks back up the stairs, Cipher. Cut her loose. Same
      as the others, except this one's your own make, so make it gentle. She's the
      last node. When her shadow comes off the network, the record's whole. Every
      node, every name, every conscript, the whole order of the build, in one place
      at last. Do it.
    seconds: 14
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 301831a480e888443b37bc9d502eee82, type: 3}
