--- !u!114 &1560271740
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1560271739}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51bf743a7b9a61e409329faa416e2f81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Ronin7.World::Ronin7.World.Story.DialoguePlayer
  lines:
  - speaker: Ronin-7 Edition
    text: The asset stays on the network. That is the order. The original is to be
      detained or terminated. Compliance is not required of the original. Removal
      is.
    seconds: 11
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e33f90d1b9d57a14ca957295b1b05c6a, type: 3}
  - speaker: Echo
    text: Cipher. Don't go looking for yourself in those eyes. Nobody's home. I've
      lived behind those eyes my whole life and I know what's missing. But the network
      woke up when he did, and it's writing your answer on the wall behind him. Rows
      of one make. Yours. All printed from one source.
    seconds: 14
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cef56538a0f92724bb977f2d6c5d00b2, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7 Edition
    text: Source-template confirmed. Original present. Designation holds.
    seconds: 4
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3434f7f1eb19c5940835e4acb6d8170e, type: 3}
  - speaker: Echo
    text: And the source has a tag on it. Seventh iteration. First that held. One
      through six, culled. The source is you, Cipher. You're not a copy of anyone.
      They built six that failed, then they built you, then they printed all of this
      off you.
    seconds: 12
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: edb493c6955acf249afa6af6533bdb3a, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: Say it again. The number. One through six.
    seconds: 6
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e635fbc1cb944b94d8db424a29140c23, type: 3}
  textMesh: {fileID: 7516581}
  panelRoot: {fileID: 1031258782}
  audioSource: {fileID: 1560271741}
  billboardToCamera: 1
  playOnStart: 0
  followDistance: 1.5
  followVerticalOffset: -0.55
  followLerp: 12
  maxCharsPerLine: 36
  autoAdvanceBeat: 0.45
  advanceAction: {fileID: -3790664182463143341, guid: d5a2441a867c2484c888f3631c932d48, type: 3}
